  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Humanitarian Capability and Training 2014/15</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Rapid response Team (RRT) provides the capacity to respond rapidly and effectively to emergency situations through the development of trained personnel as surge capacity for emergency response. Spending under this proposal includes: training and induction; clearance processes for RRT team members such as medical clearance; travel; security; communications; and deployment kits and uniforms. Also providing Post preparedness Regional Training to allow them to respond rapidly and effectively to emergency situations.</narrative>
  </description>
